        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mulizi kuti taakwe sibwaamu nanka sibusofwaazi nanka sikulikumbuzya (ncintu comwe asikukomba mituni) uukonzya kuba alukono mu-Bwami bwa-Kristo abwa-Leza.",
